// B.5: initMaint REPLACED with Maint authoritative seed.
//   Source: maint-standalone__2_.jsx lines 125-130 (5 entries verbatim).
//   Maint becomes the authority on maint shape. Extensions vs B.2 origin:
//     • reason (1-line problem description)
//     • testStatus ("Machine tested — Not Working" / "Machine still works
//       but has issue" / "Unable to test")
//     • notes[] array of {by, at, text} timeline entries
//     • parts[] entries gain vendor, eta, arrived, storage fields
//     • eqType uses Maint vocab: "Washers"/"Dryers" not "Washer"/"Dryer"
//   Dashboard's existing tile-data reads (maint.length per loc, count of
//   non-Fixed) continue to work unchanged.
//   Note: source uses MR-001..MR-005 with MR-004 at loc 2 (Fixed) and
