//   Fields per category: id (matches ticket prefix), name (display label),
//   prefix (ID generation), slaHours (SLA deadline = createdAt + slaHours),
//   assignRole (default assignee role per #21 routing rule), widget
//   (whether the category is exposed in the public website widget),
