// B.9: KB becomes authoritative for the article record shape (was a thin
// Dashboard-only stub through B.8). Standalone fields preserved: `body`
// (multi-line content), `files` (array of attachment filenames), `history`
// (array of prior versions: {ver, body, updatedBy, at}), and the existing
